------------------------------ MODULE InBlockTrace -----------------------
\* A behaviour emitted by key_row_at at these bounds: 2 passes, 3 heads,
\* 4 positions, HD = 2. The addresses are data. Next follows the trace.
\* Ordered compares each address to Formula, which Next does not call.
\* src/blocks.rs tests parse these tuples and compare them to key_row_at.
EXTENDS Integers, Sequences

CONSTANTS Kvb
ASSUME Kvb \in {1, 2}

Passes == 2
Heads == 3
B == 4
HD == 2

Formula(p, k, h, i) ==
  ((p * 2 + k) * Heads + h) * B * HD * Kvb + i * HD * Kvb

Trace2 == <<
  <<0, 0, 0, 0, 0>>,
  <<0, 0, 0, 1, 4>>,
  <<0, 0, 0, 2, 8>>,
